  "id": "sexual-aggression",
  "term": "sexual aggression",
  "definition": "Sexual aggression is aggressive sexual behavior in which a person is harmed as a victim or acts as a perpetrator. In psychology, the term should be understood in a gender-inclusive way, because both women and men can be victims and both women and men can be perpetrators.",
